# Rope Bridge Gorge - the side quest "The Idol's Bridge" played through (plan Relic of the Seventh Tide, side B)
# Two halves at 4 m, the gorge x -6..6; the bridge along z 0 from x -9.2 to 9.2; the porch 20..26 x -3..3 at 4.
# 10-25 deep pass: after the porch, the builders' coffer (cave 30 -32) tried without its key, the Lantern Hill (-30 34,
# 16 m; trail foot -30 21) and Kett's mast (the key), the cave, then the drowned camp house at 40 42 (-9 m).
island Rope Bridge Gorge
offset 0 0
expect title The Idol's Bridge
walk -24 0 to -12 0 h=4
zone bridge_lip
read Idol warning
walk -12 0 to 0 0 to 10 0 to 14 0 h=4
zone temple_ground
kill Warthog
expect step 3
walk 19 0 to 22 0 h=4
open Idol's offering
expect item TradeToken 6
zone far_porch
expect step 5
open Builders' coffer
expect message coffer key
zone lanternfoot
expect step 6
zone lanterntop
expect step 7
read Kett's note on the hill
expect step 8
open Kett's lookout box
wait 3
expect story cofferkey 1
expect step 9
zone buildcave
expect step 10
open Builders' coffer
wait 2
expect step 11
read Silas Grey's note
expect step 12
zone camphouse
read Dr. Ostrander's note
expect done
